sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant G as Gateway
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant D as Database

    C->>G: POST /api/login
    G->>A: validate credentials
    A->>D: query user
    D-->>A: user row
    A->>A: verify password hash
    alt valid credentials
        A-->>G: JWT token
        G-->>C: 200 + token
    else invalid
        A-->>G: 401 Unauthorized
        G-->>C: 401 error
    end
